                                                "example_id": "77e8a754-5a15-4de3-b437-6cc4ecfcdd74",
                                                "sense_id": "db3cd670-6201-314f-8dde-a849ee472439",
                                                "text": "The six anterior teeth are \"figure eighted\" together as well and retraced \"en masse.\""
